---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
<div class="site-container">

  <section class="home-lede">
    <div class="home-lede-pitch">
      <p>The problems you are living through have names. Not the names commonly given to them: not "market failure," not "corporate greed," not "regulatory capture." Those describe symptoms. This site traces mechanisms.</p>
      <p>The mechanism, in most cases, is the same. A state authority issues an exclusive grant: a patent, a zoning restriction, a franchise monopoly, a ballot access law. The grantee stops competing. The product degrades. The public pays and has nowhere else to go.</p>
      <p>That is not capitalism failing. That is state-granted monopoly succeeding.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="home-lede-links">
      <a href="/method/">The method &rarr;</a>
      <a href="#domains">Writing &darr;</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-domains" id="domains" aria-labelledby="domains-label">
    <span class="section-label" id="domains-label">Writing</span>

    {% for domain in domains %}
    {% set domainPosts = collections["domain_" + domain.key | replace("-", "_")] %}
    {% set postCount = domainPosts | length %}
    <div class="domain-row">
      <div class="domain-row-info">
        <h2 class="domain-row-title">
          <a href="/{{ domain.key }}/">{{ domain.title }}</a>
        </h2>
        <p class="domain-row-desc">{{ domain.description }}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="domain-row-count" aria-label="{{ postCount }} {% if postCount == 1 %}piece{% else %}pieces{% endif %}">
        {{ postCount }} {% if postCount == 1 %}piece{% else %}pieces{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% if domainPosts | length > 0 %}
      <div class="domain-row-posts-preview">
        <ul class="post-preview-list" aria-label="Recent {{ domain.title }} pieces">
          {% for post in domainPosts | limit(3) %}
          <li class="post-preview-item">
            <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
            <span class="post-preview-date">{{ post.date | dateReadable }}</span>
          </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>

</div>
